"Surprises abound here, in a unique tale of the utmost artistry\" - Animation Magazine \n\nDuration: 6 minutes 29 seconds.", "short_description": "This ground-breaking interactive stop-motion animation is the first collaboration between the National Film Board of Canada, Felix & Paul Studios and Clyde Henry Productions. Blending 3D 360-degree video, miniatures and CGI, GYMNASIA pushes the art of puppet animation into uncharted territory. Viewers shrink to 1/3 scale as they enter a world built entirely by hand. GYMNASIA is a dark dream \u23af unsettling and weirdly wonderful. \n\nDuration: 6 minutes 29 seconds."}]}, "developer_name": "Felix & Paul Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://privacy.felixandpaul.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Felix & Paul Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.felixandpaul.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "EXPLORATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr_CA"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "789825955882983"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974826_1596597043818571_2450834168754470912_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9i7-f9mIuFgQ7kNvwHyVYcQ&_nc_oc=Adltjve7xMfTSVBqcZUR8lpAl9H86T6YMgz9yQhbQu9iVz6aIkL0UbsM4uV7u0F58GM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyduC-NCn14aMLockUIp1UXrCXts2d55qnM86E-TB0P0g&oe=69AECCC7"}, "